## Performance

The charts below are built from the [SEGUL benchmark data](https://github.com/hhandika/segul-bench) (SEGUL v0.20.0). Desktop runs used Linux on an AMD Ryzen 9 5900X. [AMAS](https://github.com/marekborowiec/AMAS) and [goalign](https://github.com/evolbioinfo/goalign) are included for comparison. The [SEGUL paper](https://doi.org/10.1111/1755-0998.13964) describes the methods.

